  "rulesText": "You have honed your martial prowess and gain a Fighting Style feat of your choice (see “Feats”). Defense is recommended.\n\nWhenever you gain a Fighter level, you can replace the feat you chose with a different Fighting Style feat.\n\nFighter Features",
